# Backlog & product memory

Before proposing large new features, check [BACKLOG.md](../../BACKLOG.md) for known bugs and planned work.

When the user reports a bug or asks to “remember later”:
1. Add or update an item in `BACKLOG.md` (do not invent completion).
2. Prefer fixing listed **Bugs** before greenfield features unless the user prioritizes otherwise.

When implementing backlog items, mark them done in `BACKLOG.md` with a short note under **Done**.
